# The Sleet Kilns (CIPlay the_sleet_kilns): the plan The Rainmakers' seventh island, quest "Seeding Salt"
# The kiln yard (3 m) round 0 6 r 28: five kilns at x -20..20 z 2 (Kiln 4's door at 10 -0.7); the smelter house
# x -3..3 z 14..18.5; salt heaps at -22 18, 22 18, -24 -12; the tram stop at 0 -46, the tramway up x 0 to z -18.
island The Sleet Kilns
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Seeding Salt
wait 3
expect hidden ambushzone
zone tram_stop
expect step 1
read Kiln master's log
expect step 2
use scales
expect message three sacks of salt
use saltheap1
use saltheap1
expect message taken a sack
use saltheap2
use saltheap3
expect story saltsack 3
use scales
expect story weighed 1
expect step 3
open Kiln store
expect message locked
open Kiln 4 door
expect story storekey 1
expect step 4
open Kiln store
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_SmelterElectric 1
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractorAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_AnchorStationaryAdvanced 1
expect step 8
expect shown ambushzone
zone ambush
wait 2
kill Hyena
expect done
